review-api.test.ts\\\"],\\\"removed\\\":[],\\\"totalAfterStory\\\":556,\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\":3},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"selfReview\\\":{\\\"passesRun\\\":2,\\\"findingsFixed\\\":[\\\"Confirmed AC-1.1 through AC-1.3 are covered in behavior by stripping shell ownership fields, preserving process-local current-material projection, and enabling referenced-artifact review entry without ownership transfer.\\\",\\\"Validated the in-scope test-plan obligations with added server coverage for shell summary shape, current-material reference behavior, and cross-process referenced review access.\\\",\\\"Caught and fixed the temporary integration regression from a too-narrow current-ref-only reviewability rule, then re-ran both story and epic gates successfully.\\\"],\\\"findingsSurfaced\\\":[]},\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"specDeviations\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"Proceed to verification, focusing on cross-process artifact reference behavior in the project shell, process materials, and review entry paths before starting Story 2 write-path realignment.\\\"}\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/streams/005-self-review-batch.stdout.log:3:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_0\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"agent_message\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ready-for-verification\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"planSummary\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Realigned project artifact association around current process refs and project-scoped shell summaries by removing legacy ownership implications from shell reads, deriving current-material artifact roles from revision provenance instead of artifact-row ownership hints, and allowing referenced artifacts to remain reviewable without regressing existing produced-artifact and package review flows.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"changedFiles\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Derives process artifact role labels from artifact version provenance so current materials reflect current refs instead of legacy artifact ownership hints.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Expands review target eligibility to include current process refs while preserving existing produced-artifact and package review visibility.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Allows artifact review when the process currently references the artifact, while keeping prior produced-artifact access intact.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds coverage that project-shell artifact summaries strip legacy process ownership fields from API output.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds coverage for referenced-artifact materials labeling and review availability from current refs.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds coverage for reviewing an artifact referenced by a later process but produced by an earlier one.\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"tests\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"added\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"modified\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"removed\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"totalAfterStory\\\\\\\